<title>DUBAI: Saudi Q3 prices grow 1.1 percent vs Q3 1995.</title>
<headline>Saudi Q3 prices grow 1.1 percent vs Q3 1995.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia's cost of living index in ten cities rose 1.1 percent in the third quarter of 1996 over the same quarter the previous year, Saudi Arabian Monetary Agency (SAMA) figures show.</p>
<p>Detailed data (Pct changes on same qtr previous year)</p>
<p>		     Q3 1996	   Q2 1996	  Q3 1995</p>
<p> General index    +1.1		+1.0	     +5.0</p>
<p> All food	   +3.0		+2.0	     +0.7</p>
<p> Housing	    +0.6		+0.6	     +6.4</p>
<p>	 Indices</p>
<p>		     Q3 1996	   Q2 1996	  Q3 1995</p>
<p> General index    115.7	     115.6	    114.4</p>
<p> All food	   119.5	     118.4	    116.0</p>
<p> Housing	    123.8	     124.2	    123.1</p>
<p>(Index base 1988=100)</p>
</text>
